{"id":"ccbc12:problem:b-p2001","answer":"ISAAC NEWTON","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>上方的图片既可以看作电子轨道图，也可以看作太阳系示意图。右侧的六个符号是炼金符号。（顺带一提，左侧的那个符号也是炼金符号，而且可以复制。）</p>","text":"上方的图片既可以看作电子轨道图，也可以看作太阳系示意图。右侧的六个符号是炼金符号。（顺带一提，左侧的那个符号也是炼金符号，而且可以复制。）","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>把点之前的罗马数字按照元素周期表转换成元素，再用点之后的罗马数字取该元素（根据某规则）对应天体的字母。注意有一个字母需要上下翻转一下。</p>","text":"把点之前的罗马数字按照元素周期表转换成元素，再用点之后的罗马数字取该元素（根据某规则）对应天体的字母。注意有一个字母需要上下翻转一下。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>通过上半部☉符号（可复制），可以发现其他符号均为Unicode中的星体符号，同时也能表示金属，对应关系属下：</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>符号</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>行星（英文）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>金属（原子数）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>☿</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>水星（Mercury）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>汞（80）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>♀</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>金星（Venus）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>铜（29）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>♂</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>火星（Mars）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>铁（26）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>♃</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>木星（Jupiter）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>锡（50）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>♄</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>土星（Saturn）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>铅（82）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>☉</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>太阳（Sun）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>金（79）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>☾</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>月亮（Moon）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>银（47）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>下半部分的每一对罗马数字中前一个对应元素周期表各元素原子数，根据每一对数字中的后一个取对应天体英文单词字母得到答案：<strong>ISAAC NEWTON</strong>。</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>罗马数字转换</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>提取</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Sn.4</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Jup</span><span>i</span><span>ter</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Fe.4</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Mar</span><span>s</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Fe.2</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>M</span><span>a</span><span>rs</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Pb.2</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>S</span><span>a</span><span>turn</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Hg.4</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Mer</span><span>c</span><span>ury</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Cu.3</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Ve</span><span>n</span><span>us</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Cu.2</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>V</span><span>e</span><span>nus</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Hg.1（上下翻转）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>M(-&gt;</span><span>W</span><span>)ercury</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Sn.5</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Jupi</span><span>t</span><span>er</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Ag.3</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Mo</span><span>o</span><span>n</span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>Pb.6</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>Satur</span><span>n</span></span></section></td></tr></tbody></table>","text":"通过上半部☉符号（可复制），可以发现其他符号均为Unicode中的星体符号，同时也能表示金属，对应关系属下：\n\n符号\n行星（英文）\n金属（原子数）\n☿\n水星（Mercury）\n汞（80）\n♀\n金星（Venus）\n铜（29）\n♂\n火星（Mars）\n铁（26）\n♃\n木星（Jupiter）\n锡（50）\n♄\n土星（Saturn）\n铅（82）\n☉\n太阳（Sun）\n金（79）\n☾\n月亮（Moon）\n银（47）\n\n下半部分的每一对罗马数字中前一个对应元素周期表各元素原子数，根据每一对数字中的后一个取对应天体英文单词字母得到答案：\nISAAC NEWTON\n。\n\n罗马数字转换\n提取\nSn.4\nJup\ni\nter\nFe.4\nMar\ns\nFe.2\nM\na\nrs\nPb.2\nS\na\nturn\nHg.4\nMer\nc\nury\nCu.3\nVe\nn\nus\nCu.2\nV\ne\nnus\nHg.1（上下翻转）\nM(->\nW\n)ercury\nSn.5\nJupi\nt\ner\nAg.3\nMo\no\nn\nPb.6\nSatur\nn","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[]}
